From 449fa648febbf570d41532e99cd8dda51b7dddfc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 13:24:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: subgroup-cooperative TQ mat-vec
 (tq3_1s/tq4_1s/tq3_4s)

Register WHT via subgroupShuffleXor replaces the 32-thread shared-memory butterfly: no hot-loop barriers, workgroup unpinned (subgroup or 4x size class, NUM_ROWS=2). Legacy 32-thread shaders stay as the fallback for devices without 32-multiple subgroups, and GGML_VK_DISABLE_TQ_SUBGROUP=1 forces them for A/B measurement. Float rotated activation throughout (the mmvq-tq.cu:105-119 fp16-store bias cannot recur). Mirror pairs registered in arifi_sync_check (49->52).

Origin: ArifiLabs (native)
Measured-effect: 27B tq3_4s tg32 0.67->1.80 t/s; 0.5b tq4_1s tg64 44.7->126.7, tq3_1s 45.5->107.1; mat-vec kernel n=1 3.1-3.4x (780M, evidence lane-163)
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/arifi_sync_check.py      |   5 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          |  71 ++++-----
 .../vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_tq_sg.comp     | 135 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp     |  14 ++
 4 files changed, 189 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec_tq_sg.comp

